00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:24.750
The suspenseful, heart-pounding dance dance
Hara-hara doki-doki dansu dansu

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:28.240
An exhilarating, thrilling chance chance
Uki-uki waku-waku chansu chansu

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:23.100
There's no doubt this will be
the latest and greatest drug.

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:29.470
It seems my thirty-million credit investment
is about to yield a hefty return.

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:46.560
Wait!

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.600
W-What is it? I'm busy.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:58.370
We have to go, Yuri.
The 3WA just ordered us to retreat.

00:02:58.370 --> 00:02:59.810
Are you serious?

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:00.810
Oh, my.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:05.210
The higher-ups are being pressured,
so they're telling us to back off.

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:06.680
You've got to be kidding me!

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:11.550
So they're saying we should just let
Mahogany finish developing his new drug?

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:14.290
If we move in now, we can
shut the entire project down!

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:19.660
I know that. Tell it to the higher-ups who
are afraid to stand up to that idiot, Mahogany.

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:22.660
Kei!

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.270
Yuri, I'm outta here!

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.270
She might have jumped off!

00:03:57.270 --> 00:04:03.230
Something's Amiss!?
Our Elegant Revenge

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:23.050
Well, aren't you handsome.

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.390
Ugh. Get a room!

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.780
That Yuri...

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.320
Jeez, what's taking her so long?

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:12.040
She couldn't have!

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:39.070
There's a cold martini waiting for you.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:43.270
You saw me naked, didn't you?

00:05:43.270 --> 00:05:46.400
I wanted to, but the maid
kicked me out of the room.

00:05:46.910 --> 00:05:50.850
I'd like to know the name of
the thief who stole a kiss from me.

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.810
Names are meaningless.

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:56.850
I'm a man of many names and identities.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.850
One of them is Daniel Sezar.

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.920
Daniel Sezar?

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:05.690
Oh, you seem to like that name...

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:07.760
...Lovely Angel Yuri.

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:11.930
You're that fraud who cons an enormous sum of
money from wealthy big-shots every few years.

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:14.100
Con-artist, swindler...

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.640
It's Mahogany, isn't it?

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.700
You've chosen Mahogany
as your next target, haven't you?

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:20.440
So, why did you save me?

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.380
Any man would jump at the chance...

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:26.270
...to work with a charming,
quick-witted woman like yourself.

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:30.080
Don't you agree?

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.420
You did see me naked, didn't you?

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:36.750
We were so close!

00:06:36.860 --> 00:06:40.430
We could have blown away Mahogany and his
entire drug project with one bazooka shot!

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:42.500
Why'd you have to stop us?

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.670
The 3WA has no choice
but to look the other way.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.100
Talk to me after you've calmed down.

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.200
Then what about Yuri?

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.230
Gooley, you spineless wimp!

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:53.930
Cold-hearted bastard!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:57.210
Now what?!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.810
Hi.

00:06:59.280 --> 00:07:03.120
Yuri! Where are you? What are
you doing? You're alive?

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:06.350
You're not calling me from heaven, are you?
Show me your feet! Your feet!

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:09.290
Jeez, calm down. See? Feet.

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.630
Huh? What did you say?

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:18.730
You heard me right.

00:07:18.730 --> 00:07:24.140
We're going to con Mahogany into buying
Planet Heldora for thirty million credits.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:28.580
The details of the plan and our
roles in the con are written here.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:30.280
W-Wait just a minute.

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:33.720
Heldora? You mean that good-for-nothing rock
that's called the worst planet in the galaxy?

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.650
Normally, no one would pay
even one million credits for it.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:39.850
This is the hunk's idea, isn't it?

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:42.660
What a headache...

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:57.370
That guy must be up to something,

00:07:57.370 --> 00:08:01.370
especially if he's going out of his way to choose
3WA Trouble Consultants as his partners.

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:04.250
I'm sure he is. But who cares?

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.080
It'll be a fun game.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.410
Yeah, I guess.

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.520
Let's do it then, shall we?

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:14.150
If we con Mahogany out of thirty million credits,
his drug project is sure to go...

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:16.320
It's not a bad deal, right?

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:19.890
Not at all. And Daniel's a hunk, to boot.

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:20.990
What do you mean?

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:24.520
Oh, come on.

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:29.670
I'm not into pretentious idiots.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:30.810
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:31.900
Drop it, already!

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:35.540
Okay, okay! Stop!

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.530
Everything is going as planned.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.790
I see...

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:01.060
To the human race.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.570
Cheers.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:05.240
C-Cheers.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.080
Pardon me, I have to use the restroom.

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:13.210
Okay.

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:16.550
You must be Mr. Melnard?

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:18.680
No, you've got the wrong guy. I'm...

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.930
"We'd like to show you the gold, as promised."

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:34.900
"Please come to BC561,
our previously discussed location."

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:36.770
"We ask that you continue
to keep this a secret."

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.430
Gold?

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:41.480
Father Mahogany, let's go
to another bar, shall we?

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:42.670
Oh, ah...

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:43.540
Huh?

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:45.770
Bartender, where's the
other guy who was just here?

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:46.750
Eh?

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:48.980
The young guy. He had
brown hair, and his eyes were...

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.190
There's no one here like that.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.920
I always work this counter alone.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.430
What's the matter, Father?

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:03.120
N-Nothing...

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:14.110
Brocks Company 561...

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:18.110
BC561...

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:22.950
B... C...

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:25.550
Brocks Company...

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:27.480
Let's go, Father.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:31.390
Oh, I just remembered that I have
an appointment. I'll meet you there.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:32.290
Take care, then.

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:52.880
You must be Mr. Melnard Bodre?

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:56.050
Lady El-nui Kajak is waiting for you.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.610
O-Okay...

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.290
Please, come in.

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.680
I've been waiting for you.

00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:31.080
Welcome, Mr. Melnard.

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:32.620
Please, come this way.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:32.890
G-Good to see you.
Please, come this way.

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:33.990
G-Good to see you.

00:11:33.990 --> 00:11:38.150
I see you have quite eccentric taste...

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:42.360
What's behind here?

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:44.830
Y-You're!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:47.630
Please make yourself comfortable.

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:56.840
This thing's so hot! I'm sweating.

00:11:56.840 --> 00:12:01.320
We swore that only you and I
would know the secret of Planet Heldora.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.010
Have you kept your promise?

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:05.110
Heldora?

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:07.090
O-Of course.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:10.110
Well then, allow me to take you there.

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:11.730
Shall we?

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.490
Y-Yes, let's...

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:22.070
That's right. I'm on my way to Heldora.

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:25.070
I'm certain there's some
big money involved here.

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:27.740
They think I'm someone else,
but I'll use that to my advantage.

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:28.610
What?

00:12:28.980 --> 00:12:32.240
Have I ever failed to make money?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.920
What a simple-minded guy.

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.380
Sorry, but could you put out your cigar?

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:40.190
You're just as beautiful from this angle.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:43.520
The ventilation system in here is worthless,
so could you please stop smoking?

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:50.030
Say, Yuri.

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:54.370
Why don't you leave the 3WA and come with me?

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.340
You're asking me to become a con-artist?

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:57.700
I suppose.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:00.400
How's the fake gold coming along?

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:04.940
My partner left before we did, so she
could get everything ready for our plan.

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:18.960
On this 256,000 hectares of land...

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:21.830
...stands a beautiful mansion
worth 380,000,000 credits.

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:25.530
Have a look at all of these opulent
and extravagant home furnishings.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:29.990
These are all the property
of Miss El-nui Kajak.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.540
She's young, yet incredibly wealthy.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.140
What's more, it's rumored that she
built her fortune quite recently.

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:40.680
One might describe her as a modern day
Cinderella, a magical princess.

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.650
Mr. Melnard Bodre?

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.620
C-Come in.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:50.580
Thank you for waiting. We're close
enough to see Planet Heldora now.

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:08.510
Common knowledge is that Planet Heldora
is only kept around for its meager coal mine.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:11.900
However, that story is just a front.

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:17.850
Just a few years ago, after I
inherited this planet from my father,

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:21.190
we discovered that this planet
holds a great deal of gold.

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:23.590
I have been diligently
hiding that fact ever since.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.150
After all, why would I not?

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:29.330
I'd rather not deal with taxes
and public property claims.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:34.560
Please, come this way.
We'll show you the goods.

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:36.600
Hurry, or we won't make it!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:48.010
Here, have a look.

00:15:06.900 --> 00:15:13.540
As promised, we'll sell you complete ownership
of Planet Heldora for twenty million credits.

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:16.810
I-I-I'd like some time to think.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:17.970
This is all quite sudden, so...

00:15:26.090 --> 00:15:28.090
I just have too much gold.

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:30.250
I'm running out of places to put it all.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.730
Twenty million credits...

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:43.740
I could gather that amount,
if I postpone the other project.

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:45.970
However, there are too many risks involved.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.080
You're saying we have the wrong man?

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:52.280
That's right! I'm Melnard!

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:54.210
That other guy is a fake!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:59.390
Well, whoever he is, if he's willing to
purchase Heldora for twenty million credits...

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:01.820
In that case, I'll pay twenty-five million!

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:04.420
Twenty-five million?

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:07.930
Heldora is a virtually
inexhaustible goldmine!

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:10.730
It's well worth twenty-five million credits.

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:14.200
I'll pay twenty-six million credits!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.500
Twenty-six million!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.770
Twenty-seven million credits!

00:16:17.770 --> 00:16:19.800
I have the right to buy it, too!

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:22.010
Twenty-eight million!

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.570
T-Twenty-nine million!

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:31.150
Th-Th-Th-Th-Th...

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:32.410
...Thirty million!

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:34.760
I'll pay thirty million credits!

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.550
W-What? I'd go bankrupt!

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:38.790
Congratulations.

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:41.250
Heldora is yours.

00:16:45.370 --> 00:16:46.870
It'll finally happen tomorrow, won't it?

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:49.600
The exchange will be at
Port Dorlin, seven o'clock.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:57.570
Well then, I'm gonna go
keep an eye on Mahogany.

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:02.540
Enjoy.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:07.050
Why don't you have a seat?

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:10.460
Don't you think it's about time you told me
what's going to happen tomorrow?

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:11.450
What do you mean?

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:15.720
What you plan to do after you
con thirty million credits out of him.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:23.660
It seems to me that you work too hard.

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:26.430
You're always thinking about crime...

00:17:30.340 --> 00:17:33.370
You've forgotten just how beautiful you are.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:37.710
"I partnered with you because
I'm genuinely interested in you."

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:39.480
"Yes, I..."

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:43.220
I love you.

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:48.890
It's true...

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:52.000
Sorry.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.300
You see...

00:17:53.430 --> 00:17:58.170
...I make it a point never to trust the advances
of con men and no-interest moneylenders.

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:01.010
See you tomorrow.

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:22.890
There he is.

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:27.270
He's here, Yuri. It's just one air car.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:29.430
I don't see anyone else suspicious.

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:32.730
He trusts us completely, eh? What a fool.

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:46.450
Thirty million credits.

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:51.420
All real.

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:56.800
Here then, please examine it
for yourself. It's the deed to Heldora.

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:01.270
President!

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:04.370
They're imposters! This is all a sham!

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.770
It's the Dirty Pair!

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:07.840
W-What?!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:17.950
Yuri!

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.220
W-Where'd he go?

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:29.490
Daniel!

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:38.840
Kill him! Get my money back!

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:04.290
Ah, no!

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:12.500
Just who do you think you're dealing with?

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:17.610
Help me!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:19.040
Yuri!

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:22.950
That's what you get for
double-crossing the Lovely Angels.

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:27.710
We knew all along that
you'd rat us out to Mahogany.

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:37.060
Looks like it's game over, Daniel.

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:41.730
I hope this teaches you to never
try and deceive the Lovely Angels again.

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:44.210
Mahogany, that goes for you, too!

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:48.640
You can pressure the 3WA all you want,
but it's not going to stop us.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:49.840
Got it?

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:55.240
She's the first woman
who didn't fall for my advances.

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:56.620
Hey, Yuri.

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.590
Have a good time together, you two.

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:01.580
You know, that guy's obsession
with money is pretty impressive.

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:08.060
Thirty million credits! My thirty million!

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:11.330
Well then...

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:11.570
Are you okay?
Well then...

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:12.470
Are you okay?

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:13.330
Why do you ask?

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:13.570
Your arm.
Why do you ask?

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:14.270
Your arm.

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:15.740
Don't underestimate me.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:24.540
Bye-bye.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:36.260
Nice shot.

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:36.490
Why, thank you.
Nice shot.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:37.320
Why, thank you.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.300
M-My thirty million credits!

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:49.860
